  "description": "An unexpected phone call gave Jordan Rejaud the idea for an app that's now done $1.5M in revenue. And he's done it with zero ads, no content, and a customer base most founders would never think to build for.\n\n*Free database → 190+ Micro-SaaS Ideas Making Millions:* https://clickhubspot.com/emfw \n\nFollow Jordan: https://x.com/jordanrejaud\nCheck out Parakeet Chat: https://parakeet.chat/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild\n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nThis video is an educational case study of this founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - You've never heard of this app\n0:54 - What's your story?\n1:26 - Founder background\n2:03 - Building the app\n2:28 - Find a niche app idea\n3:11 - Tech stack (and why it doesn't matter)\n4:27 - How he found the app idea\n5:28 - Validating the idea\n6:20 - Advice for actually validating ideas\n7:35 - Growth\n8:43 - What does this app do?\n9:42 - How does it make money?\n10:11 - App revenue and statistics \n11:27 - Advice: Make more mistakes\n12:58 - Pat and Gus reflections: build niche apps!",
